WEBVTT

00:03:56.857 --> 00:04:01.737
But coin and paper money get value

00:04:01.737 --> 00:04:06.534
only when they’re validated
by an external authority,

00:04:06.534 --> 00:04:12.373
such as God, crown or the central bank.

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:18.879
Technology today enables us

00:04:18.879 --> 00:04:23.426
to bypass the need
for this central authority.

00:04:24.427 --> 00:04:29.181
Today, the value of any asset
can be transferred

00:04:29.181 --> 00:04:31.267
from one person to another